      "body": "@willdoran can you verify this is correct, from our chat last friday ? \r\n- We believe the right to be forgotten wins here over the right to save the data (that should not have been saved)\r\n- We are deleting all messages and blanking out post content and post.title where they match the tweet\r\n- We need to notify the users of the twittter datasource so they know this is coming \r\n- We can do this with a migration since it will apply to everyone who has used the Twitter datasource at any point\r\n\r\nI'll send a PR in a bit if that's the case.",
